{"seq":2,"slug":"user-experience","title":"大学设计学 — 用户体验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design/user-experience","wordCount":1532,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学设计学-用户体验设计\">大学设计学 — 用户体验设计</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>用户体验 (User Experience, UX) 设计关注的是人与产品交互过程中的整体感受，而非单一界面的视觉美观。一次完整的网购体验涵盖搜索、浏览、下单、等待、拆包等多个触点，每个触点都影响用户对品牌的整体评价。UX 设计师的工作就是系统地优化这些触点，使整体体验流畅、高效且令人愉悦。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>核心方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户研究</td>\n<td>访谈、问卷、日志研究、影随观察</td>\n<td>发现真实需求而非假设需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息架构</td>\n<td>卡片分类、树状测试、站点地图</td>\n<td>组织内容使用户能快速找到目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互设计</td>\n<td>线框图、原型、微交互</td>\n<td>定义用户与界面之间的行为逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性评估</td>\n<td>启发式评估、用户测试、A/B 测试</td>\n<td>用数据验证设计假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务设计</td>\n<td>旅程地图、服务蓝图、触点矩阵</td>\n<td>从单屏扩展到全链路体验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"用户研究方法论\">用户研究方法论</h3><p>用户研究是 UX 设计的起点。定性研究揭示&quot;为什么&quot;，定量研究回答&quot;多少&quot;。常见方法按探索深度排列：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>桌面研究 (Desk Research)</strong> — 分析竞品、行业报告、用户评论</li>\n<li><strong>问卷调查</strong> — 大样本收集态度与偏好数据，样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 需满足置信度要求：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\geq \\frac{z^2 \\cdot p(1-p)}{e^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = 1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 置信水平），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为预估比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 为允许误差。</p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><strong>深度访谈</strong> — <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 名用户即可发现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>+ 的关键洞察（Nielsen 发现曲线）</li>\n<li><strong>情境访查 (Contextual Inquiry)</strong> — 在用户真实环境中边观察边提问</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;  A[研究目标定义] --&gt; B{定性 or 定量?}&#10;  B --&gt;|定性| C[访谈/观察/日志]&#10;  B --&gt;|定量| D[问卷/分析数据/A-B测试]&#10;  C --&gt; E[亲和图归纳]&#10;  D --&gt; F[统计分析]&#10;  E --&gt; G[用户画像 Persona]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[设计机会点]\">graph TB\n  A[研究目标定义] --&gt; B{定性 or 定量?}\n  B --&gt;|定性| C[访谈/观察/日志]\n  B --&gt;|定量| D[问卷/分析数据/A-B测试]\n  C --&gt; E[亲和图归纳]\n  D --&gt; F[统计分析]\n  E --&gt; G[用户画像 Persona]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[设计机会点]</pre><h3 id=\"信息架构与导航设计\">信息架构与导航设计</h3><p>信息架构 (Information Architecture, IA) 决定内容的组织与标签。Hick 定律指出用户做决策所需时间与选项数量的对数成正比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = a + b \\cdot \\log_2(n + 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为选项数量。这意味着层级菜单每层应控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 个选项内。</p>\n<p>卡片分类 (Card Sorting) 是确定信息分组的核心方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>开放式</strong>：用户自定义分组和标签 → 发现心智模型</li>\n<li><strong>封闭式</strong>：预设分类，用户将卡片归入 → 验证分类方案</li>\n</ul>\n<p>树状测试 (Tree Testing) 则在没有视觉界面的情况下验证导航层级的可找性 (findability)，成功率低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 的路径需要重新设计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"交互设计与原型工具\">交互设计与原型工具</h3><p>交互设计将信息架构转化为可操作的界面行为。Fitts 定律量化了指向动作的难度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MT</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi></mrow><mi>W</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MT} = a + b \\cdot \\log_2\\!\\left(\\frac{2D}{W}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为指针到目标的距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为目标宽度。设计启示：重要按钮应放大、靠近常用区域。</p>\n<p>原型从低保真到高保真依次为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纸质原型</td>\n<td>纸笔</td>\n<td>快速验证流程</td>\n<td>数分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低保真线框</td>\n<td>Balsamiq, Whimsical</td>\n<td>结构与布局</td>\n<td>数小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中保真交互</td>\n<td>Figma, Axure</td>\n<td>交互逻辑与过渡</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高保真原型</td>\n<td>Figma + 动效, ProtoPie</td>\n<td>接近真实体验</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>微交互 (Micro-interaction) 是提升体验细腻度的关键：按钮按下的涟漪效果、加载时的骨架屏、成功提交的动画反馈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可用性测试与度量\">可用性测试与度量</h3><p>可用性测试是 UX 设计中最有说服力的验证手段。Jakob Nielsen 的研究表明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 名测试者可发现约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">85\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85%</span></span></span></span></span> 的可用性问题，发现率公式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(n) = 1 - (1 - L)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\approx 0.31</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.31</span></span></span></span></span> 为单个用户发现问题的平均概率。关键度量指标包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>任务成功率</strong> (Task Success Rate)：直接完成 vs 间接完成 vs 失败</li>\n<li><strong>任务耗时</strong> (Time on Task)：与基准线对比</li>\n<li><strong>错误率</strong> (Error Rate)：操作偏离预期路径的次数</li>\n<li><strong>SUS 评分</strong> (System Usability Scale)：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 题标准化问卷，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>68</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">68</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">68</span></span></span></span></span> 分为平均水平</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[招募测试者] --&gt; B[设计任务脚本]&#10;  B --&gt; C[引导测试 Think Aloud]&#10;  C --&gt; D[记录行为数据]&#10;  D --&gt; E[问题严重度评级]&#10;  E --&gt; F[优先级排序 &amp; 迭代]\">flowchart LR\n  A[招募测试者] --&gt; B[设计任务脚本]\n  B --&gt; C[引导测试 Think Aloud]\n  C --&gt; D[记录行为数据]\n  D --&gt; E[问题严重度评级]\n  E --&gt; F[优先级排序 &amp; 迭代]</pre><h3 id=\"从屏幕到全链路-服务设计视角\">从屏幕到全链路：服务设计视角</h3><p>UX 不止于屏幕。服务设计 (Service Design) 将视角扩展到用户旅程的全部触点。用户旅程地图 (Customer Journey Map) 沿时间轴记录行为、情绪和痛点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>前台触点</strong>：广告、App 界面、客服对话</li>\n<li><strong>后台流程</strong>：物流调度、数据处理、审核机制</li>\n<li><strong>支持系统</strong>：CRM、内容管理、监控告警</li>\n</ul>\n<p>服务蓝图在旅程地图基础上增加&quot;可见线&quot;和&quot;内部交互线&quot;，揭示前后台之间的依赖关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为一款校园图书馆座位预约 App 设计开放式卡片分类实验：列出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 张功能卡片，招募 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 名同学执行分类，记录分组结果并绘制亲和图。</li>\n<li>使用 Fitts 定律分析手机底部导航栏（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个图标）的点击效率，计算从屏幕中央到各图标的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MT</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MT</span></span></span></span></span></span> 值，讨论哪个位置最易触达。</li>\n<li>对一个你常用的网站进行启发式评估（使用 Nielsen 十大原则），列出发现的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个可用性问题并按严重度排序。</li>\n<li>绘制一次线上购物的用户旅程地图，标注至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 个触点及对应的情绪曲线。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《用户体验要素》(The Elements of User Experience)</strong> — Jesse James Garrett，UX 五层模型经典</li>\n<li><strong>《About Face: 交互设计精髓》</strong> — Alan Cooper，交互设计方法论体系</li>\n<li><strong>NNGroup 文章库 (nngroup.com)</strong> — Nielsen Norman Group 持续更新的 UX 研究与最佳实践</li>\n<li><strong>《This is Service Design Doing》</strong> — 服务设计方法工具书，含大量实战案例</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>用户体验设计是一个从&quot;理解用户&quot;出发，经过&quot;组织信息—设计交互—验证假设&quot;循环迭代的过程。用户研究提供洞察、信息架构搭建骨架、交互设计塑造行为、可用性测试闭合反馈环。当视野从单一界面扩展到服务全链路时，UX 设计师就能创造出不仅好用、更令人信赖的产品体验。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学设计学 — 用户体验设计","id":"大学设计学-用户体验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"用户研究方法论","id":"用户研究方法论"},{"level":3,"text":"信息架构与导航设计","id":"信息架构与导航设计"},{"level":3,"text":"交互设计与原型工具","id":"交互设计与原型工具"},{"level":3,"text":"可用性测试与度量","id":"可用性测试与度量"},{"level":3,"text":"从屏幕到全链路：服务设计视角","id":"从屏幕到全链路-服务设计视角"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学设计学 — 工业设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design/industrial-design"},"next":{"title":"大学设计学 — 设计思维","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design/design-thinking"}}